---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getMediaAsset } from '../data/media-manifest';

const title = 'Services | USIVA Visa-Readiness Planning';
const description = 'Organize U.S. visa and immigration planning records, timing, official-source checks, and responsible handoffs for the next decision.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/services.html';
const workPhoto = getMediaAsset('employment-engineering');
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  activePath="/services.html"
  canonical={canonical}
  topbarMessage="Informational planning · verify current instructions with the responsible authority."
  topbarLink={{ label: 'Open official tools', href: '/official-tools.html' }}
>
  <section class="services-intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="shell-container services-intro__grid">
      <div class="services-intro__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">USIVA / services</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Make the next immigration question visible before it becomes urgent.</h1>
        <p class="services-intro__lede">USIVA is a visa and immigration planning companion for individuals, families, employers, and organizations working through nonimmigrant or immigrant questions. The work starts with a clear file, a named decision, and the right official source to verify it.</p>
        <p><strong>Planning inputs:</strong> stage · activity · date · source owner.</p>
        <nav class="intro-actions" aria-label="Services next steps">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/contacts.html">Prepare a question</a>
          <a class="button button--outline" href="/visa.html">Browse visa routes</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <figure class="services-figure">
        <img
          src={workPhoto.src}
          width={workPhoto.width}
          height={workPhoto.height}
          alt={workPhoto.alt}
          sizes="(min-width: 900px) 38vw, 100vw"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <figcaption>{workPhoto.caption}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section service-lanes" aria-labelledby="lane-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Choose the question first</p>
        <h2 id="lane-heading">Different stages need different planning conversations.</h2>
        <p>These lanes focus on what to organize and verify. Current eligibility, approval, representation, and employment decisions come from the responsible authority.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <caption>USIVA planning lanes and their next source</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Stage</th><th scope="col">Question to name</th><th scope="col">Useful next reference</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Before applying</th>
              <td>What evidence and timing should I clarify before I spend money or submit a packet?</td>
              <td><a href="/visa-categories.html">Visa categories <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">During study or research</th>
              <td>Which activity needs school, sponsor, or other authorization before it begins?</td>
              <td><a href="/official-tools.html">Official tools <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">For employers and coordinators</th>
              <td>Who owns the next employment or records decision, and what needs to be written down?</td>
              <td><a href="/employers.html">Employer resources <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="ledger-heading">
    <div class="shell-container ledger-layout">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">A service ledger</p>
        <h2 id="ledger-heading">What careful planning can put in order.</h2>
        <p>Each move ends with a question for the authority that can actually confirm the answer.</p>
      </header>

      <ol class="service-ledger">
        <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Build a readiness file</h3><p>Collect the identity, academic, funding, travel, and prior-visa records relevant to the decision in front of you.</p></div><p><strong>Verify with</strong> the school, program, sponsor, employer, or counsel named for your situation.</p></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Map the pathway</h3><p>Put stages, dates, owners, documents, and unresolved questions on one page so a missed handoff is easier to see.</p></div><p><strong>Keep current</strong> when a school instruction, government source, or program term changes.</p></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Name authorization boundaries</h3><p>Separate study, assistantship, research exposure, internship, travel, and employment instead of treating them as interchangeable.</p></div><p><strong>Ask first</strong> before beginning an activity that may require written authorization.</p></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Leave a source trail</h3><p>Save the public rule, school instruction, sponsor note, or professional advice that informed the next step, with the date checked.</p></div><p><strong>Escalate</strong> when the facts are personal, disputed, or too complex for general planning content.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section services-guardrail" aria-labelledby="guardrail-heading">
    <div class="shell-container services-guardrail__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">The line that matters</p>
        <h2 id="guardrail-heading">Good planning keeps authorization in the lead.</h2>
        <p>USIVA can help a reader frame the question. The university, designated school official, sponsor, employer, government agency, or licensed immigration attorney must provide the answer that controls the individual case.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="guardrail-list">
        <p><span>01</span><strong>Before payment</strong> confirm who is providing what, under which terms, and whether the information is current.</p>
        <p><span>02</span><strong>Before activity</strong> ask whether study, training, research, travel, or work needs written approval.</p>
        <p><span>03</span><strong>Before filing</strong> check the current government and program instructions, then seek individualized advice when needed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section services-next" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">A useful next step</p>
        <h2 id="next-heading">Bring the decision in front of you.</h2>
        <p>Start with your current stage, the activity or filing you are considering, the date that matters, and the document or instruction that needs the responsible authority’s interpretation.</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="next-reference-list">
        <li><a href="/briefs.html"><strong>Read a research brief</strong><span>See source-led explanations of planning questions.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/articles.html"><strong>Open an article</strong><span>Follow a longer explanation with a clear limitation.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacts.html"><strong>Draft the question brief</strong><span>Prepare the smallest useful handoff.</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="source-note">For current public instructions, begin with <a href="https://www.uscis.gov/" rel="noreferrer">USCIS</a>, <a href="https://studyinthestates.dhs.gov/" rel="noreferrer">DHS Study in the States</a>, or the <a href="https://travel.state.gov/content/travel/en/us-visas.html" rel="noreferrer">Department of State visa pages</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .services-intro {
    background: var(--color-mist);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .services-intro__grid {
    align-items: end;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.78fr);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .services-intro__copy {
    max-width: 60rem;
  }

  .services-intro h1 {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .services-intro__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .services-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .services-figure img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
  }

  figcaption {
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-1);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-1);
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 58rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .ledger-layout > header h2,
  .services-next h2,
  .services-guardrail h2 {
    max-width: 24ch;
  }

  .section-heading > p:last-child,
  .ledger-layout > header > p:last-child,
  .services-next > div > header > p:last-child {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-1);
  }

  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 44rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  caption {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-1);
    text-align: start;
  }

  th,
  td {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-1);
    text-align: start;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  thead th {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    color: var(--color-soft);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  tbody th {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    width: 24%;
  }

  td {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  td a {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ledger-layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr);
  }

  .service-ledger {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .service-ledger li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(12rem, 0.7fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
  }

  .service-ledger li > span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .service-ledger h3 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-end: 0.25rem;
  }

  .service-ledger p {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .service-ledger li > p {
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-1);
  }

  .service-ledger li > p strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-guardrail {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .services-guardrail h2 {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .services-guardrail__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
  }

  .services-guardrail__grid > div:first-child > p:last-child {
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
  }

  .guardrail-list {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .guardrail-list p {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
  }

  .guardrail-list span {
    color: var(--color-paper);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .guardrail-list strong {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .services-next {
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .next-reference-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .next-reference-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .next-reference-list a {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .next-reference-list strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .next-reference-list span,
  .source-note {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .source-note {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .source-note a {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .services-intro__grid,
    .ledger-layout,
    .services-guardrail__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .services-figure {
      max-width: 42rem;
    }

    .service-ledger li {
      grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .service-ledger li > p {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .intro-actions .button {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .next-reference-list a {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
